      "message": "Could these two codepaths be combined, like so?\n\n...\n                            mClients.remove(msg.replyTo);\n                            if (cInfo.isLegacy()) {\n                                mLegacyClientCount -\u003d 1;\n                            }\n                        }\n                        maybeScheduleStop();\n                        break;\n...\n\nAs far as I can see:\n\n- The new logic you\u0027re adding in this CL shouldn\u0027t change, because mLegacyClientCount can only reach 0 if cInfo.isLegacy() is true.\n- Existing codepaths shouldn\u0027t change either:\n  - if mClients.size() \u003d\u003d 0, then isAnyRequestActive() will return false, and maybeScheduleStop will call scheduleStop.\n  - if mClients.size() !\u003d 0, then the old code wouldn\u0027t do anything, but maybeScheduleStop wouldn\u0027t do anything either.\n\nbut I might be missing something because there are lots of codepaths here.",
