      "writtenOn": "2021-07-19T04:59:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we do that, every time a non-legacy client is disconnected(assuming no legacy client here), the code would schedule a DAEMON_CLEANUP event, but we might want the DAEMON_CLEANUP is scheduled only when \n1. the last client is disconnected.\n2. the last legacy client is disconnected.",
